      "questionText": "<p><strong>Drag and drop to complete the following dialogues.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_1_-_career_7eedadf4.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Dialogue 1:</em></strong></p>\n<p>David: What kind of person would be good for a job as a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.1</label><input id='fbo-910980-0' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='0' name='fbo-910980-0' type='text' size='19' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910980-0' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Linda: It is great for someone who enjoys routine tasks and working with their hands in a fast-paced environment.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Dialogue 2:</em></strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Do you think I am suitable for working as a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.2</label><input id='fbo-910980-1' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='1' name='fbo-910980-1' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910980-1' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Tom: Definitely! You can make clothes yourself and they are beautiful. It's a perfect job for you!</p>\n<p><strong><em>Dialogue 3:</em></strong></p>\n<p>Emily: Do you think being a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.3</label><input id='fbo-910980-2' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='2' name='fbo-910980-2' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910980-2' /></span></strong> is a fun job?</p>\n<p>Jack: Yes, it&#8217;s great for people who enjoy talking to customers and working in a lively place.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Dialogue 4:</em></strong></p>\n<p>Mia: I&#8217;m looking for a part-time job to earn some extra money for my studies. Any suggestions?</p>\n<p>Mike: You can consider working as a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.4</label><input id='fbo-910980-3' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='3' name='fbo-910980-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910980-3' /></span></strong>. It's a part-time job with flexible hours, and easy to do. You just have to scan items and handle payments.</p>",
