      "questionName": "mechanic, hair salon, hairdresser, software engineer",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/set_1_-_career_choices_2_5cbcf258.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Ben: I&#8217;m thinking about becoming a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-910998-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-910998-0' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910998-0' /></span></strong>. I love fixing cars and learning how they work.</p>\n<p>Lily: That sounds interesting! I&#8217;m more into creative jobs. I&#8217;m considering working in a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-910998-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-910998-1' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910998-1' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>Ben: It sounds fun! What would you do there?</p>\n<p>Lily: I would like to become a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-910998-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-910998-2' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910998-2' /></span></strong>. I enjoy styling hair and making people look good.</p>\n<p>Ben: That&#8217;s cool! Both careers are different, but both can be rewarding.</p>\n<p>Lily: Yes, they are! Have you ever thought about being a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-910998-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-910998-3' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910998-3' /></span></strong>? It&#8217;s a good job for problem-solvers.</p>\n<p>Ben: I&#8217;ve thought about it, but I prefer working with my hands.</p>",
