      "questionName": "career choice, vocational college, earn a living, apply for something",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"287\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"287\">A <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-911005-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-911005-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911005-0'></option><option value=\"housing\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-0-housing'>housing</option><option value=\"health\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-0-health'>health</option><option value=\"food\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-0-food'>food</option><option value=\"career\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-0-career'>career</option></select></span> </strong>choice is an important decision that can shape your future. Some people decide to attend a vocational<strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"135\"> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-911005-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-911005-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911005-1'></option><option value=\"college\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-1-college'>college</option><option value=\"orchard\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-1-orchard'>orchard</option><option value=\"kindergarten\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-1-kindergarten'>kindergarten</option><option value=\"lighthouse\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-1-lighthouse'>lighthouse</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;to learn specific skills for jobs like mechanic, hairdresser, or chef. These schools teach practical skills that help students start working quickly.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"484\">Others may want to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-911005-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-911005-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911005-2'></option><option value=\"create\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-2-create'>create</option><option value=\"do\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-2-do'>do</option><option value=\"earn\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-2-earn'>earn</option><option value=\"serve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-2-serve'>serve</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;a living in a different way, like working in an office or starting their own business. Whatever you choose, it&#8217;s important to think about your interests and strengths.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"844\" data-is-last-node data-is-only-node>If you want to start a career, you may need to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-911005-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-911005-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911005-3'></option><option value=\"care\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-3-care'>care</option><option value=\"pay\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-3-pay'>pay</option><option value=\"apply\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-3-apply'>apply</option><option value=\"wait\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911005-3-wait'>wait</option></select></span> </strong>for a job or an internship. This process can help you gain experience and find out if a job is right for you. Remember, it's fine to change your mind as you learn more about different career paths. The most important thing is to choose something that makes you happy and helps you grow.</p>",
