      "questionText": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"44\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"44\">Read the following leaflet and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"44\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"44\">Looking for a Career in Beauty? Join Our Vocational College!</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"373\">Are you looking for a rewarding and exciting career in beauty career?&nbsp;Discover how you can gain practical skills, build confidence, and start working in a job you love!</p>\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"410\"><strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"410\">What You Can Achieve</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"640\">\n<li data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"557\">Learn how to style, cut, and color hair with practical lessons to help you become <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-911010-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-911010-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911010-0'></option><option value=\"useless\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-0-useless'>useless</option><option value=\"skillful\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-0-skillful'>skillful</option><option value=\"fresh\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-0-fresh'>fresh</option><option value=\"amateur\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-0-amateur'>amateur</option></select></span></strong> in your job.</li>\n<li>Enjoy a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-911010-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-911010-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911010-1'></option><option value=\"unfriendly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-1-unfriendly'>unfriendly</option><option value=\"stress-free\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-1-stress-free'>stress-free</option><option value=\"dangerous\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-1-dangerous'>dangerous</option><option value=\"noisy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-1-noisy'>noisy</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;environment while you practice your skills and build confidence.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"685\">What We Provide</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"969\">\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"787\">Hands-on training at professional<strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"717\"> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-911010-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-911010-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911010-2'></option><option value=\"weaving workshops\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-2-weaving workshops'>weaving workshops</option><option value=\"convenience stores\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-2-convenience stores'>convenience stores</option><option value=\"farmers' markets\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-2-farmers' markets'>farmers' markets</option><option value=\"hair salons\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-2-hair salons'>hair salons</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;in many locations in the city.</li>\n<li>Courses that are <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-911010-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-911010-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911010-3'></option><option value=\"pricey\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-3-pricey'>pricey</option><option value=\"expensive\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-3-expensive'>expensive</option><option value=\"luxury\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-3-luxury'>luxury</option><option value=\"reasonable\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-3-reasonable'>reasonable</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;in price to help you save money but still enjoy the best quality.</li>\n<li data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"878\">Skilled and experienced <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-911010-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-911010-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-911010-4'></option><option value=\"fashion designers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-4-fashion designers'>fashion designers</option><option value=\"mechanics\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-4-mechanics'>mechanics</option><option value=\"cashiers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-4-cashiers'>cashiers</option><option value=\"hairdressers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-911010-4-hairdressers'>hairdressers</option></select></span></strong> who provide direct guidance and training.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1018\"><strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1018\">Take the First Step Today!</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1163\" data-is-last-node data-is-only-node>Join us and get the training you need to succeed in your chosen career. Enroll now and begin your journey toward a fulfilling, hands-on career!</p>",
